  ($q$alg-469$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Algebra$q$, $q$Linear equations in one variable$q$, 2, null, $q$For constants b and c, the equation 7(bx + c) = 21x + 7 is true for all values of x. What is the value of b + c?$q$, $q$["11","28","4","2"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$For the equation to hold for every x, coefficients must match: 7b = 21 → b = 3, and 7c = 7 → c = 1. So b + c = 4.$q$),
