  ($q$alg-474$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Algebra$q$, $q$Word problems$q$, 2, null, $q$A print shop charges $22 for the design plus $15 per poster. An order cost $217 in total. How many posters were in the order?$q$, $q$["195","12","13","14"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$Total = fixed fee + rate × quantity: 22 + 15n = 217. So 15n = 195 and n = 13.$q$),
