  ($q$alg-588$q$, $q$math$q$, $q$Algebra$q$, $q$Linear equations in one variable$q$, 1, null, $q$If 6(x − 1) = x + 29, what is the value of x?$q$, $q$["9","−7","7","5"]$q$::jsonb, 2, $q$6x − 6 = x + 29 → 5x = 35 → x = 7.$q$),
